# Relative collapse of the punctured finite Hopf ball onto the interior simplex boundary

A second collapse of the punctured seventeen-vertex ambient complex runs in the opposite
direction from the original finite Hopf boundary.  This file certifies 321 elementary collapses
onto the five-tetrahedron boundary of the distinguished all-interior four-simplex.  Together
with the boundary collapse, it identifies the comparison between the two domain spheres as a
homotopy equivalence.
-/

noncomputable section

